      en: ["Ros Beiaard parade every 10 years", "Gothic Town Hall (UNESCO)", "Confluence of two rivers", "13th-century Beguinage"],
      es: ["Desfile de Ros Beiaard cada 10 años", "Ayuntamiento gótico (UNESCO)", "Confluencia de dos ríos", "Beguinaje del siglo XIII"],
