      en: ["Site of the Battle of the Bulge", "Mardasson Memorial", "Bastogne War Museum", "Gateway to the High Fens"],
      es: ["Escenario de la Ofensiva de las Ardenas", "Monumento de Mardasson", "Bastogne War Museum", "Puerta a las Hautes Fagnes"],
      pt: ["Cenário da Ofensiva das Ardenas", "Monumento de Mardasson", "Bastogne War Museum", "Porta para as Hautes Fagnes"],
